From: Armada <noreply@armada.local>
Subject: [PATCH] scsi: ufs: qcom: deep-suspend set (Pocknix 0201/1007/1008/1010/1015 folded)

Folded UFS suspend set from the Pocknix/ROCKNIX deep-suspend stack
(jaewun), rebased onto v7.2: drain relink completions out-of-band PM,
hibern8-exit clk-scale propagation, auto-hibern8 collision, mphy park,
rx-linecfg disable after link startup. Deep suspend uses LINK_OFF on
this platform; one UFS host reset per resume is expected.

